      <Docs>
        <summary>A source of phone number: provided by an app that has carrier privilege.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>A source of phone number: provided by an app that has carrier privilege. The number is intended to be set by a carrier app knowing the correct number which is, for example, different from the number in UICC for some reason. The number is not available until a carrier app sets one via setCarrierPhoneNumber(int,String). The app can update the number with the same API should the number change.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/telephony/SubscriptionManager#PHONE_NUMBER_SOURCE_CARRIER" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.telephony.SubscriptionManager.PHONE_NUMBER_SOURCE_CARRIER</code>.</a></format></para>
